OL,3,GNEWSAMan's shock at Spain flight using
OL,4,Awife's passport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who mistakenly travelled to Spain
OL,7,Fusing his wife's passport has said he
OL,8,Fis still baffled about how he was able
OL,9,Fto make the trip without being stopped
OL,10,Fin the UK.
OL,12,FBen Moore, from Talke, in
OL,13,FStaffordshire, noticed there was a
OL,14,Fproblem soon after getting off his
OL,15,FRyanair flight while he was queuing to
OL,16,Fget his passport checked at Alicante
OL,17,Fairport.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
