OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan's shock at Spain flight using
OL,4,Awife's passport
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I opened up the passport there and, to
OL,7,Fmy horror, it was my wife's photo on
OL,8,Fthe passport," he said. "The lads who I
OL,9,Fwas with basically said the colour
OL,10,Fdrained out of me immediately."
OL,12,FThird-party provider Swissport, which
OL,13,Fcarries out Ryanair's checks at
OL,14,FManchester Airport where Moore flew
OL,15,Ffrom, said it was now reinforcing
OL,16,Fmandatory boarding procedures.
